    "intro_narrative": "Rain lashes against the window of the safehouse. You are standing in the abandoned office of 'The Architect,' a notorious data broker who vanished three days ago. He left behind a tangled web of digital security measures and encrypted servers. Your client needs the master key hidden within this system to prevent a financial meltdown. The room is filled with humming servers, scattered notes, and strange standalone computing devices. To find the key, you must trace the flow of data, decrypt the layers, and boot up the mainframes in the correct order. The clock is ticking.",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
  },
